---
title: Gluten-Free Pork Carnitas
description: Our Authentic Gluten-Free Pork Carnitas (Better Than a Restaurant) are the ultimate crowd-pleaser. Every bite delivers mouthwatering, caramelized pork that's tender on the inside and perfectly crispy on the outside. This recipe is so irresistible, our family makes a batch at least once a month!
image: https://cakesandcoriander.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Savory-Carnitas-3-Large.jpeg
prep time: 15 minutes
servings: 12
cook time: 2 hours 15 minutes
source: https://cakesandcoriander.com/authentic-mexican-carnitas/
course: Main Course
cuisine: Mexican
tags: Authentic, Mexican, Pork
diet: Diabetic, GlutenFree
---

Preheat your oven to 350°F and move the oven racks to make room for a #Dutch Oven{}.

Evenly combine @salt{2%tsp}, @black pepper{2%tsp}, @oregano{1%Tbsp}, and @cumin{2%tsp} on the @Pork Shoulder{4%Lbs}(cut into large pieces).

Place your Dutch Oven on the stove and set the heat to medium-high. Add @lard{1/4%Cup} and once at a high heat, add the pork. Brown a few sides for approximately ~{2-3%minutes} each. (Depending upon the size of your Dutch Oven, you may have to brown in 2 batches.)

Once browned, add @onion{2%Cups}(slivered), @garlic{1/4%Cup}(crushed/chopped), and @apple cider vinegar{2%Tbsp}. Deglaze the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon, then add @chicken broth{3%Cups}(enough to cover 75% of the meat).

Bring the Dutch Oven to a boil, place the lid on and slide it in the oven.

Once in the oven, reduce the temperature to 325°F and cook for ~{135%minutes} or until the pork is tender.

Once done, remove the pork, using two forks, lightly shred the pork to bite-sized pieces. To get the nice rich and crispy flavor/texture, broil on high for about ~{2-3%minutes} any pork you plan to serve.

Plate with some @cilantro{} and your favorite Mexican sides and serve!

> For a subtle citrus, add a splash of orange juice or lime juice during the cooking alongside the chicken broth. For a stronger citrus profile, replace 1 cup of chicken broth with 1 cup orange juice.